{"seq":3,"slug":"replication-capacity-cost","title":"跨区带宽、容量与成本","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/global-active-active-database/replication-ops/replication-capacity-cost","wordCount":2643,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"跨区带宽-容量与成本\">跨区带宽、容量与成本</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>跨区复制是一项<strong>按写入量重复付费</strong>的支出，而且它的重复次数等于副本数量。这一点与单区域系统有本质区别：在单区域里增加一个副本只消耗本地磁盘与 IO，成本增长接近线性但基数很低；在多活架构里，每一次写入都要在每条跨区链路上产生出流量，副本跨越的区域越多，同一笔写入被传输的次数越多，成本近似按「写入量 × 跨区链路数」放大。因此容量规划与成本估算必须成为拓扑设计的输入，而不是上线后由财务部门发现的问题。</p>\n<p>更关键的是，跨区带宽不只是账单上的数字，它同时是一个<strong>容量约束</strong>：链路带宽被占满时，复制会开始排队，延迟上升，而这个延迟会通过第二章讨论的机制传导为读一致性下降与 RPO 恶化。因此「带宽够不够」这个问题的正确答案不是「出流量有没有超预算」，而是「在峰值写入速率下，复制延迟是否仍在目标范围内」。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  W[主库写入 W MB/s] --&gt; L1[链路 1 至区域 B]&#10;  W --&gt; L2[链路 2 至区域 C]&#10;  W --&gt; L3[链路 3 至区域 D]&#10;  L1 --&gt; O1[出流量 = W]&#10;  L2 --&gt; O2[出流量 = W]&#10;  L3 --&gt; O3[出流量 = W]&#10;  O1 --&gt; C[月度成本 ≈ W × 3 × T × 单价]&#10;  O2 --&gt; C&#10;  O3 --&gt; C&#10;  C --&gt; B{峰值链路利用率}&#10;  B --&gt;|&gt; 70%| Q[复制排队&lt;br/&gt;延迟上升]&#10;  B --&gt;|&lt; 70%| H[健康余量]\">graph TD\n  W[主库写入 W MB/s] --&gt; L1[链路 1 至区域 B]\n  W --&gt; L2[链路 2 至区域 C]\n  W --&gt; L3[链路 3 至区域 D]\n  L1 --&gt; O1[出流量 = W]\n  L2 --&gt; O2[出流量 = W]\n  L3 --&gt; O3[出流量 = W]\n  O1 --&gt; C[月度成本 ≈ W × 3 × T × 单价]\n  O2 --&gt; C\n  O3 --&gt; C\n  C --&gt; B{峰值链路利用率}\n  B --&gt;|&gt; 70%| Q[复制排队&lt;br/&gt;延迟上升]\n  B --&gt;|&lt; 70%| H[健康余量]</pre><h2 id=\"从写入速率到成本的换算\">从写入速率到成本的换算</h2><p>把写入速率换算成月度成本是一个可以直接计算的过程，关键在于区分三个不同的量：<strong>逻辑写入速率</strong>（业务写入的数据量）、<strong>物理日志速率</strong>（写入产生的日志量，通常大于逻辑量，因为日志包含前后镜像、索引变更、事务框架）、<strong>链路传输量</strong>（物理日志速率乘以压缩比）。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{monthly} = W_{log} \\times (1 - r_{compress}) \\times N_{links} \\times T_{month} \\times P_{egress}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ess</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">ink</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ess</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W_{log}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是平均日志速率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_{compress}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ess</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是压缩率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{links}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">ink</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是跨区链路数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{month}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是月度秒数（约 2.6 百万秒），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{egress}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ess</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是出流量单价。</p>\n<h3 id=\"公式的用途是敏感性分析\">公式的用途是敏感性分析</h3><p>这个公式最重要的用途不是算总价，而是<strong>做敏感性分析</strong>：它让「多加一个区域副本」的长期成本变得可见。举例来说，如果日志速率是 20MB/s、压缩后有效传输 8MB/s，那么每增加一条跨区链路，月度增量约为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>2.6</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>6</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">8 \\times 2.6 \\times 10^6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.6</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 字节量级的数据传输，这个数字乘以出流量单价就是新增的固定支出——而且它是每个月都发生的，不是一次性投入。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>量</th>\n<th>典型关系</th>\n<th>影响因素</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>逻辑写入速率</td>\n<td>业务数据量</td>\n<td>业务规模</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>物理日志速率</td>\n<td>逻辑量的 1.5–5 倍</td>\n<td>行宽、索引数量、事务粒度、批量操作</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>压缩后传输量</td>\n<td>日志速率的 30%–60%</td>\n<td>数据可压缩性、压缩算法与 CPU 余量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>链路数</td>\n<td>等于跨区副本数</td>\n<td>拓扑形态、合规约束</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>峰值系数</td>\n<td>平均值 2–5 倍</td>\n<td>业务峰谷比、批处理窗口</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第四行与第五行是成本控制的两个主要杠杆。链路数由拓扑决定，因此「每个区域是否需要一份完整副本」是一个成本问题——这正是下面要讲的分级复制。峰值系数决定了链路的<strong>容量</strong>需求（而不只是流量成本），因为链路必须按峰值配置才能避免排队。</p>\n<h2 id=\"带宽作为容量约束而非账单项\">带宽作为容量约束而非账单项</h2><p>链路的月度流量成本与瞬时带宽容量是两个独立的采购项，实际约束往往来自后者。判断链路是否成为瓶颈，需要看的是<strong>峰值利用率</strong>而不是平均利用率：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>峰值利用率</th>\n<th>状态</th>\n<th>表现</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>&lt; 50%</td>\n<td>充裕</td>\n<td>延迟接近 RTT，无排队</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>50%–70%</td>\n<td>健康</td>\n<td>偶发排队，延迟可控</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>70%–85%</td>\n<td>紧张</td>\n<td>批处理窗口延迟明显上升</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&gt; 85%</td>\n<td>危险</td>\n<td>持续排队，延迟随负载指数上升</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"高利用率如何进入恶性循环\">高利用率如何进入恶性循环</h3><p>超过 85% 利用率的链路会进入一个恶性循环：排队导致延迟上升，延迟上升使副本落后，落后积累后需要传输更多数据来追赶（虽然实际是同一批日志，但对监控而言落后量在增长），如果此时发生副本重建，快照传输会与生产复制争抢同一条链路，把问题放大。因此<strong>重建流量必须在容量规划中单独预留</strong>，见<a href=\"replica-rebuild-backfill\">副本重建与历史回补</a>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"按最坏情况组合规划容量\">按最坏情况组合规划容量</h3><p>一个实用的容量规划方法是按最坏情况组合计算：峰值业务写入 + 一个副本的全量重建 + 一个区域的追赶流量，三者同时发生时的总带宽必须仍在链路的可承载范围内，或者有明确的降级策略（暂停重建、延后批处理）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分级复制-不是所有数据都需要四个副本\">分级复制：不是所有数据都需要四个副本</h2><p>成本控制最有效的杠杆是减少不必要的跨区传输。核心洞察是：<strong>不同的数据对多区域副本的需求强度差别很大</strong>，而统一按最高等级复制是浪费。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>数据级别</th>\n<th>副本需求</th>\n<th>复制方式</th>\n<th>传输量占比</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>交易核心数据</td>\n<td>全区域强一致副本</td>\n<td>同步或半同步，全量日志</td>\n<td>高（但量通常不大）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>业务运营数据</td>\n<td>主要区域 + 一个异地</td>\n<td>异步，全量日志</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分析派生数据</td>\n<td>单一区域，按需拉取</td>\n<td>批量导出而非实时复制</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>日志与审计数据</td>\n<td>辖区内部 + 归档</td>\n<td>辖区内部实时，跨区批量</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>缓存与派生索引</td>\n<td>不复制，区域重建</td>\n<td>无复制，按需重建</td>\n<td>零</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最后一行是一个常被忽略的优化：缓存、物化视图、搜索索引这类<strong>可重建的派生数据</strong>不应该被复制，而应该在每个区域独立构建。复制它们的成本很高（它们通常比原始数据大），而收益很低（它们本来就能从原始数据重建）。判断标准是「这份数据如果丢失，能否从其他数据以可接受的代价重建」——能重建的就不要复制。</p>\n<p>第三行则提示了另一种优化：分析类数据往往不需要实时同步，按小时或按天批量导出比实时复制便宜得多，且完全不影响交易链路的带宽。这要求分析侧接受 T+1 或 T+1h 的数据新鲜度，而这在绝大多数分析场景下是可接受的。</p>\n<h3 id=\"压缩与增量优化的收益边界\">压缩与增量优化的收益边界</h3><p>压缩是降低传输量的直接手段，但它的收益有边界，且必须与 CPU 代价一起评估。压缩率取决于数据本身的可压缩性：结构化数值数据通常能压到 30%–50%，已经压缩过的数据（如二进制大对象、已压缩的日志字段）几乎无法再压缩，而压缩这些数据只会白白消耗 CPU 并增加延迟。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;replication_bandwidth_policy&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;per_dataset&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;orders&quot;: { &quot;class&quot;: &quot;L1&quot;, &quot;mode&quot;: &quot;semisync&quot;, &quot;compress&quot;: &quot;lz4&quot;, &quot;budget_share&quot;: 0.25 },&#10;      &quot;user_profile&quot;: { &quot;class&quot;: &quot;L2&quot;, &quot;mode&quot;: &quot;async&quot;, &quot;compress&quot;: &quot;lz4&quot;, &quot;budget_share&quot;: 0.2 },&#10;      &quot;audit_log&quot;: {&#10;        &quot;class&quot;: &quot;L4&quot;,&#10;        &quot;mode&quot;: &quot;async_batch&quot;,&#10;        &quot;compress&quot;: &quot;zstd&quot;,&#10;        &quot;batch_window_s&quot;: 900,&#10;        &quot;budget_share&quot;: 0.05&#10;      },&#10;      &quot;search_index&quot;: { &quot;class&quot;: &quot;L5&quot;, &quot;mode&quot;: &quot;none&quot;, &quot;rebuild_per_region&quot;: true },&#10;      &quot;analytics_rollup&quot;: { &quot;class&quot;: &quot;L3&quot;, &quot;mode&quot;: &quot;export&quot;, &quot;interval&quot;: &quot;1h&quot;, &quot;budget_share&quot;: 0.05 }&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;reserved_for_rebuild_share&quot;: 0.2,&#10;    &quot;alert_at_peak_utilization&quot;: 0.75&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"replication_bandwidth_policy\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"per_dataset\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"orders\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"class\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"L1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"mode\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"semisync\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"compress\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"lz4\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"budget_share\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.25</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"user_profile\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"class\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"L2\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"mode\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"async\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"compress\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"lz4\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"budget_share\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"audit_log\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"class\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"L4\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"mode\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"async_batch\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"compress\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"zstd\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"batch_window_s\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">900</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"budget_share\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.05</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"search_index\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"class\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"L5\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"mode\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"none\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"rebuild_per_region\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"analytics_rollup\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"class\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"L3\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"mode\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"export\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"interval\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"1h\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"budget_share\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.05</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"reserved_for_rebuild_share\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"alert_at_peak_utilization\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.75</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这份配置的核心设计有两个。<code>budget_share</code> 把链路带宽按数据集分配额度，任何数据集超额度时告警——这让带宽从「一个总量」变成「可归因的分配」。<code>reserved_for_rebuild_share</code> 显式预留 20% 带宽给重建与追赶，避免它们在需要时无路可走。<code>class: L5</code> 的 <code>rebuild_per_region: true</code> 则把「不复制、就地重建」这一策略写进配置，使成本优化成为架构的一部分而不是运维的习惯。</p>\n<h2 id=\"成本与可靠性的取舍\">成本与可靠性的取舍</h2><p>成本优化的边界是可靠性。两个常见的过度优化值得警惕。</p>\n<p><strong>其一是减少副本数量导致容灾能力下降。</strong> 从四个区域副本减到两个，出流量减半，但区域级故障时的可用副本集合也缩小了。判断是否可减的标准不是成本，而是「任意单区域故障后，剩余副本能否承载全部读写」，这需要容量与拓扑一起评估，而不是只看带宽账单。</p>\n<p><strong>其二是用批量代替实时导致 RPO 恶化。</strong> 把某个数据集从实时复制改为每小时批量导出，带宽成本大幅下降，但该数据集的 RPO 从秒级变成小时级。这个变化必须被写进 RTO/RPO 目标并经过业务确认，而不是作为纯技术优化静默上线——否则事故时的期望落差会比成本节省大得多。目标的定义方式见<a href=\"../failover-splitbrain/failover-rto-rpo\">RTO/RPO 目标与切换演练</a>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"优化手段的取舍表\">优化手段的取舍表</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>优化手段</th>\n<th>带宽节省</th>\n<th>影响</th>\n<th>需要确认</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>派生数据不复制、就地重建</td>\n<td>大</td>\n<td>区域重建耗时</td>\n<td>重建时间是否可接受</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分析数据改批量导出</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>RPO 从秒级到小时级</td>\n<td>业务能否接受新鲜度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>提高压缩率</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>CPU 消耗、延迟增加</td>\n<td>CPU 余量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>减少跨区副本数</td>\n<td>大</td>\n<td>容灾能力下降</td>\n<td>单区故障后容量是否够</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>降低日志冗余度</td>\n<td>小到中</td>\n<td>需重新评估复制语义</td>\n<td>与复制模式的一致性</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>跨区复制是按写入量重复付费的支出，重复次数等于跨区链路数；成本公式为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C = W_{log}(1-r_{compress}) \\cdot N_{links} \\cdot T \\cdot P_{egress}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ess</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">ink</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ess</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，其价值在于使「多加一个区域副本」的长期成本可见。</li>\n<li>物理日志速率通常是逻辑写入量的 1.5–5 倍，压缩后传输量为日志速率的 30%–60%；链路数由拓扑决定，峰值系数决定容量需求。</li>\n<li>带宽的真实约束是峰值利用率而非月度流量：&gt;85% 时延迟随负载指数上升，并可能因并发重建进入恶性循环，因此重建流量必须单独预留容量。</li>\n<li>分级复制是成本控制的主杠杆：可重建的派生数据不应复制而应就地重建，分析类数据可用批量导出替代实时复制。</li>\n<li>压缩收益有边界，已压缩数据再压缩只消耗 CPU 不降传输量；带宽应按数据集分配额度并显式预留重建份额，使成本具备可归因性。</li>\n<li>成本优化的边界是可靠性：减少副本数需验证单区故障后剩余容量，批量替代实时会把 RPO 恶化并必须重新走目标确认，见<a href=\"../failover-splitbrain/failover-rto-rpo\">RTO/RPO 目标与切换演练</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"跨区带宽、容量与成本","id":"跨区带宽-容量与成本"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"从写入速率到成本的换算","id":"从写入速率到成本的换算"},{"level":3,"text":"公式的用途是敏感性分析","id":"公式的用途是敏感性分析"},{"level":2,"text":"带宽作为容量约束而非账单项","id":"带宽作为容量约束而非账单项"},{"level":3,"text":"高利用率如何进入恶性循环","id":"高利用率如何进入恶性循环"},{"level":3,"text":"按最坏情况组合规划容量","id":"按最坏情况组合规划容量"},{"level":2,"text":"分级复制：不是所有数据都需要四个副本","id":"分级复制-不是所有数据都需要四个副本"},{"level":3,"text":"压缩与增量优化的收益边界","id":"压缩与增量优化的收益边界"},{"level":2,"text":"成本与可靠性的取舍","id":"成本与可靠性的取舍"},{"level":3,"text":"优化手段的取舍表","id":"优化手段的取舍表"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"副本重建与历史回补","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/global-active-active-database/replication-ops/replica-rebuild-backfill"},"next":null}